+           row  `NonStringKey`  10  _the map key was not a string_  解码 `Map` 时
+           row  `Absent`  11  _the CBOR value was not present_  缺少必需字段的键或密封层次结构的判别字段，或者在 `optionalityOptions.strictCborAbsence` 下 `Optional` 缺失

